NOTICE

CMO Council is an adaptation of the llm-council skill
(https://github.com/tenfoldmarc/llm-council-skill) and the LLM Council
methodology described by Andrej Karpathy
(https://x.com/karpathy/status/1962263486196867115).

Derived concepts:
- council structure
- blind peer review with randomized anonymization
- chairman synthesis of reviewed responses

CMO Council additions:
- six marketing owner seats and an optional specialist seat
- BUILD and REBUILD modes
- twelve-slot intake and capped clarifying questions
- GIVEN / BENCHMARK / ASSUMED number provenance
- conflict review and the 60% resource-cut test
- explicit CMO rulings and a costed, sequenced marketing plan
- arithmetic, capacity, ownership, decision, and traceability gates

Sibling project: https://github.com/zihadizisan/marketing-council